[
  {
    "content_id": "10029001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和华的话临到毗土珥的儿子约珥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;老年人哪，当听我的话； 国中的居民哪，都要侧耳而听。 在你们的日子， 或你们列祖的日子， 曾有这样的事吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们要将这事传与子， 子传与孙， 孙传与后代。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;剪虫剩下的，蝗虫来吃； 蝗虫剩下的，蝻子来吃； 蝻子剩下的，蚂蚱来吃。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;酒醉的人哪，要清醒哭泣； 好酒的人哪，都要为甜酒哀号， 因为从你们的口中断绝了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;有一队蝗虫又强盛又无数， 侵犯我的地； 它的牙齿如狮子的牙齿， 大牙如母狮的大牙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;它毁坏我的葡萄树， 剥了我无花果树的皮， 剥尽而丢弃，使枝条露白。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我的民哪，你当哀号，像处女腰束麻布， 为幼年的丈夫哀号。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;素祭和奠祭从耶和华的殿中断绝； 事奉耶和华的祭司都悲哀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;田荒凉，地悲哀； 因为五谷毁坏， 新酒干竭，油也缺乏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;农夫啊，你们要惭愧； 修理葡萄园的啊，你们要哀号； 因为大麦小麦与田间的庄稼都灭绝了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;葡萄树枯干； 无花果树衰残。 石榴树、棕树、苹果树， 连田野一切的树木也都枯干； 众人的喜乐尽都消灭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;祭司啊，你们当腰束麻布痛哭； 伺候祭坛的啊，你们要哀号； 事奉我　神的啊，你们要来披上麻布过夜， 因为素祭和奠祭从你们　神的殿中断绝了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们要分定禁食的日子， 宣告严肃会， 招聚长老和国中的一切居民 到耶和华—你们　神的殿， 向耶和华哀求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;哀哉！耶和华的日子临近了。 这日来到，好像毁灭从全能者来到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;粮食不是在我们眼前断绝了吗？ 欢喜快乐不是从我们　神的殿中止息了吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;谷种在土块下朽烂； 仓也荒凉，廪也破坏； 因为五谷枯干了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;牲畜哀鸣； 牛群混乱，因为无草； 羊群也受了困苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，我向你求告， 因为火烧灭旷野的草场； 火焰烧尽田野的树木。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;田野的走兽向你发喘； 因为溪水干涸， 火也烧灭旷野的草场。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你们要在锡安吹角， 在我圣山吹出大声。 国中的居民都要发颤； 因为耶和华的日子将到， 已经临近。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;那日是黑暗、幽冥、 密云、乌黑的日子， 好像晨光铺满山岭。 有一队蝗虫又大又强； 从来没有这样的， 以后直到万代也必没有。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;它们前面如火烧灭， 后面如火焰烧尽。 未到以前，地如伊甸园； 过去以后，成了荒凉的旷野； 没有一样能躲避它们的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;它们的形状如马， 奔跑如马兵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;在山顶蹦跳的响声如车辆的响声， 又如火焰烧碎秸的响声， 好像强盛的民摆阵预备打仗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;它们一来，众民伤恸， 脸都变色。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;它们如勇士奔跑， 像战士爬城； 各都步行，不乱队伍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;彼此并不拥挤，向前各行其路， 直闯兵器，不偏左右。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;它们蹦上城，蹿上墙， 爬上房屋， 进入窗户如同盗贼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;它们一来， 地震天动， 日月昏暗， 星宿无光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和华在他军旅前发声， 他的队伍甚大； 成就他命的是强盛者。 因为耶和华的日子大而可畏， 谁能当得起呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说：虽然如此， 你们应当禁食、哭泣、悲哀， 一心归向我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们要撕裂心肠， 不撕裂衣服。 归向耶和华—你们的　神； 因为他有恩典，有怜悯， 不轻易发怒， 有丰盛的慈爱， 并且后悔不降所说的灾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;或者他转意后悔，留下余福， 就是留下献给耶和华—你们　神的素祭和奠祭， 也未可知。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你们要在锡安吹角， 分定禁食的日子， 宣告严肃会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;聚集众民，使会众自洁： 招聚老者， 聚集孩童和吃奶的； 使新郎出离洞房， 新妇出离内室。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;事奉耶和华的祭司 要在廊子和祭坛中间哭泣，说： 耶和华啊，求你顾惜你的百姓， 不要使你的产业受羞辱， 列邦管辖他们。 为何容列国的人说： 「他们的　神在哪里」呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;耶和华就为自己的地发热心， 怜恤他的百姓。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;耶和华应允他的百姓说： 我必赐给你们五谷、新酒，和油， 使你们饱足； 我也不再使你们受列国的羞辱；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;却要使北方来的军队远离你们， 将他们赶到干旱荒废之地： 前队赶入东海， 后队赶入西海； 因为他们所行的大恶， 臭气上升，腥味腾空。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;地土啊，不要惧怕； 要欢喜快乐， 因为耶和华行了大事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;田野的走兽啊，不要惧怕； 因为，旷野的草发生， 树木结果， 无花果树、葡萄树也都效力。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;锡安的民哪，你们要快乐， 为耶和华—你们的　神欢喜； 因他赐给你们合宜的秋雨， 为你们降下甘霖， 就是秋雨、春雨，和先前一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;禾场必满了麦子； 酒榨与油榨必有新酒和油盈溢。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;我打发到你们中间的大军队， 就是蝗虫、蝻子、蚂蚱、剪虫， 那些年所吃的，我要补还你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;你们必多吃而得饱足， 就赞美为你们行奇妙事之耶和华—你们　神的名。 我的百姓必永远不至羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;你们必知道我是在以色列中间， 又知道我是耶和华—你们的　神； 在我以外并无别神。 我的百姓必永远不致羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;以后，我要将我的灵浇灌凡有血气的。 你们的儿女要说预言； 你们的老年人要做异梦， 少年人要见异象。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;在那些日子， 我要将我的灵浇灌我的仆人和使女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;「在天上地下，我要显出奇事，有血，有火，有烟柱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002031",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;日头要变为黑暗，月亮要变为血，这都在耶和华大而可畏的日子未到以前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002032",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:32",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002032",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>32</sup>&nbsp;到那时候，凡求告耶和华名的就必得救；因为照耶和华所说的，在锡安山，耶路撒冷必有逃脱的人，在剩下的人中必有耶和华所召的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;「到那日，我使犹大和耶路撒冷被掳之人归回的时候，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我要聚集万民，带他们下到约沙法谷，在那里施行审判；因为他们将我的百姓，就是我的产业以色列，分散在列国中，又分取我的地土，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;且为我的百姓拈阄，将童子换妓女，卖童女买酒喝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;「泰尔、西顿，和非利士四境的人哪，你们与我何干？你们要报复我吗？若报复我，我必使报应速速归到你们的头上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们既然夺取我的金银，又将我可爱的宝物带入你们宫殿，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;并将犹大人和耶路撒冷人卖给希腊人，使他们远离自己的境界。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我必激动他们离开你们所卖到之地，又必使报应归到你们的头上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我必将你们的儿女卖在犹大人的手中，他们必卖给远方示巴国的人。这是耶和华说的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;当在万民中宣告说： 要预备打仗； 激动勇士， 使一切战士上前来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;要将犁头打成刀剑， 将镰刀打成戈矛； 软弱的要说：我有勇力。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;四围的列国啊， 你们要速速地来， 一同聚集。 耶和华啊， 求你使你的大能者降临。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;万民都当兴起， 上到约沙法谷； 因为我必坐在那里， 审判四围的列国。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;开镰吧！因为庄稼熟了； 践踏吧！因为酒榨满了。 酒池盈溢； 他们的罪恶甚大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;许多许多的人在断定谷， 因为耶和华的日子临近断定谷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;日月昏暗， 星宿无光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;耶和华必从锡安吼叫， 从耶路撒冷发声， 天地就震动。 耶和华却要作他百姓的避难所， 作以色列人的保障。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你们就知道我是耶和华—你们的　神， 且又住在锡安—我的圣山。 那时，耶路撒冷必成为圣； 外邦人不再从其中经过。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;到那日，大山要滴甜酒； 小山要流奶子； 犹大溪河都有水流。 必有泉源从耶和华的殿中流出来， 滋润什亭谷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;埃及必然荒凉， 以东变为凄凉的旷野， 都因向犹大人所行的强暴， 又因在本地流无辜人的血。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;但犹大必存到永远； 耶路撒冷必存到万代。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我未曾报复流血的罪， 现在我要报复， 因为耶和华住在锡安。</p>"
  }
]